{"id":8,"titleZh":"古斯塔夫·马勒是谁？","titleEn":"Who Is Gustav Mahler?","date":"1960-02-07","dateZh":"1960 年 2 月 7 日","concepts":"“双重人”、声乐交响曲、告别与永恒","thesis":"马勒体内的指挥家与作曲家、天真孩童与绝望成人终生撕裂，这种矛盾反而造就了极度诚实、毫不遮掩的音乐。","plain":"百年诞辰之际，同样身兼指挥与作曲两职的伯恩斯坦最懂马勒内心的冲突。马勒性格大喜大悲，从未写过歌剧，却把人声、民歌与中国古诗搬进庞大的交响曲里；他既能调度巨型编制，也常用几件乐器写出细微的孤独感。","scenes":["演《第四交响曲》第三乐章接女高音格里斯特唱的《天国生活》时，伯恩斯坦在歌词间停下来让乐队模仿小羊与公牛叫声，呈现孩童视角的天堂菜单。","先请女低音海伦·拉布演唱谐谑歌曲《圣安东尼向鱼群布道》，紧接着让乐队奏出由它改写而成的《第二交响曲》第三乐章，对照展示歌曲如何生长成宏大交响曲，最后以《大地之歌》结尾渐逝收场。"],"category":"大师与杰作","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1Ut411P72G","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ut411P72G","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 古斯塔夫·马勒是谁？","duration":"53:03","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/who-is-gustav-mahler","repertoire":[{"composer":"Mahler","piece":"Symphony No. 4 in G Major","titleZh":"第四交响曲","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Mahler%20Symphony%20No.%204%20in%20G%20Major+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Mahler%20Symphony%20No.%204%20in%20G%20Major"},{"composer":"Mahler","piece":"Das Lied von der Erde (Youth & The Farewell)","titleZh":"大地之歌（青春与告别）","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Mahler%20Das%20Lied%20von%20der%20Erde+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Mahler%20Das%20Lied%20von%20der%20Erde"},{"composer":"Mahler","piece":"Symphony No. 2 in C Minor (Resurrection)","titleZh":"第二交响曲“复活”","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Mahler%20Symphony%20No.%202%20in%20C%20Minor+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Mahler%20Symphony%20No.%202%20in%20C%20Minor"},{"composer":"Ma